                    One Smart Screen. Endless Hospitality Experiences.
                </h2>
                
                <p class="font-heading text-[12.5px] sm:text-[14px] font-normal leading-[1.6] md:leading-[1.7] text-[#D6E4F0] mb-3 sm:mb-3.5">
